bel":"标记：用头孢、甲硝唑这类抗菌药期间和停药后 7 天内不喝酒，藿香正气水、止咳糖浆这类含酒精的药也不碰"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。一周多不喝酒，吃别的药前看一眼成分里有没有乙醇。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["这叫双硫仑样反应。福建省药监局 2023 年的安全用药科普说，部分头孢类药物服药前后饮酒，可能引发这种反应，「会严重损害健康甚至导致生命危险」。症状有面部潮红、出汗、心悸，甚至呼吸困难、血压下降、过敏性休克。科普按《中华人民共和国药典临床用药须知》列出的药，有头孢唑林、头孢曲松、头孢哌酮、甲硝唑、替硝唑、呋喃唑酮等。科普写明「用药后 7 天内禁止饮酒和食用含酒精的药物、食物等」，例子有酒心巧克力和藿香正气水。理由是被药抑制的那种酶，常要 4 到 5 天才能恢复。广州一家医院整理了 2 年里的 82 例病例。由头孢类引起的 57 例（69.51%），硝基咪唑类（甲硝唑、替硝唑这类）10 例（12.20%）。酒精来自酒类饮料的 40 例（48.78%），来自含乙醇药物的 31 例（37.80%）。口服的有藿香正气水、止咳糖浆、益母草流浸膏等。82 例里轻度 68 例、中度 9 例、重度 5 例，1 到 3 小时内缓解，没有死亡。美国甲硝唑说明书要求，用药期间和停药后至少 3 天不喝酒，也不用含丙二醇的产品。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["福建省药品监督管理局（福建省药品科普与监管数据中心）(2023). 2023年“全国安全用药月”原创科普小知识——为什么吃头孢不能喝酒. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://yjj.scjgj.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/kpzl/qgaqyyy/202312/t20231215_6334595.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://yjj.scjgj.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/kpzl/qgaqyyy/202312/t20231215_6334595.htm"]},"；房财富, 涂星, 刘韬, 黄红兵, 邱孟, 梁蔚婷 (2015). 我院双硫仑样反应82例分析. 中国药房, 26(29):4089-4091. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.6039/j.issn.1001-0408.2015.29.19","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.6039/j.issn.1001-0408.2015.29.19"]},"；Pfizer (2026). FLAGYL 375 (metronidazole) capsules, prescribing information: Contraindications, Interaction with Alcohol. DailyMed. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=a2883ca1-5a9a-4259-9d80-46ab67274384","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=a2883ca1-5a9a-4259-9d80-46ab67274384"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不是每一种头孢都会这样，但普通人分不清，吃哪种都照这条做最省事。医生开头孢或甲硝唑时，主动说一句最近几天喝没喝过酒。那篇科普建议用药前 3 天也别喝，同时承认这个间隔目前没有权威说法。一旦脸红心慌，马上停掉含酒精的东西。科普说轻的能自己缓过来，重的要送医院。吃对乙酰氨基酚期间也别喝酒，见本节第 1 条（对乙酰氨基酚）。定 B 是因为证据是病例整理和说明书，没有对照。收益定「小」：那 82 例都在几小时内缓过来，没有死亡，重度的只有 5 例。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/34-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"过期药和用不上的剩药定期清出来，连包装投进有害垃圾桶，别留在家里"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/34-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["2 岁以下的孩子感冒，别自己喂复方感冒药和止咳药"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["国家药监局要求 14 种儿童复方感冒药加上警示：不建议家长自己给 2 岁以下孩子用，要在医生或药师指导下用。在孩子身上做的试验里，止咳药、抗过敏药效果都不比安慰…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/34-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["怀孕 20 周以后，别自己吃布洛芬这类止痛药"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["怀孕 20 周以后，羊水大部分是胎儿的肾做出来的。这时吃布洛芬这类药，可能伤到胎儿的肾、让羊水变少。美国收到的这类报告里，有新生儿死亡的病例。医生开的小剂量阿司…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/34-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["反酸烧心自己买奥美拉唑，最多吃 7 天；吞咽困难、呕血、黑便就直接去医院"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["奥美拉唑肠溶片从 2022 年起不用处方就能买，但说明书写明自己吃不超过 7 天，两个月内别再吃。吞咽困难或疼痛、呕血、便血或黑便时不要自己吃，这些可能是严重情…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/34-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["普通感冒别找医生要抗生素"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["感冒吃抗生素，好得不比不吃快。成年人吃了，副作用的风险是不吃的两倍多。流脓鼻涕不到 10 天的，吃抗生素也没有确定的好处。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/34-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["拉肚子先喝口服补液盐补水，5 岁以下的孩子不给止泻药"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["拉肚子最要紧的是补水，不是止泻。按说明书兑水喝口服补液盐，别拿果汁饮料代替，太甜反而让人更缺水。5 岁以下的孩子不给洛哌丁胺这类止泻药，严重的会肠梗阻，可能致命…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/34-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["止痛药一个月别吃超过 15 天，复方止痛药别超过 10 天，不然头痛可能就是药吃出来的"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["头痛老犯、就天天吃止痛药，可能越吃越痛。国际头痛分类把这叫药物过度使用性头痛。普通止痛药一个月吃 15 天以上，复方止痛药 10 天以上，连着超过 3 个月，就…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/34"},"children":["阅读整个主题：家里的常备药别吃出事 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"